    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d685">

                <pb facs="0656" n="558" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg558"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. W. H. Crossman &amp;
                            Bro. to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-01-15"><hi rendition="#italic">January 15,
                        1900</hi></date>,</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram 13th instant received with thanks. Our letter 13th instant explains
                    our position clearly to date. Do not desire any attempt for settlement made, for
                    the present at least.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. H. Crossman &amp; Bro.</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
